      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it's just hard because i feel like im being ungrateful. like i have no right to feel this way when there's nothing actually \"wrong\" in my life. but the numbness is so heavy. it's like i'm just waiting for something to happen, but i know nothing will. i just wish i could find a way to make the quiet stop. or maybe just make everything stop. it feels like such a waste of energy just to exist like this.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
